3,1,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help! To make sure our new service doesn't run into unexpected trouble, maybe we should check the bus links in the outer wards and the winter road closures?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. While logistics are certainly vital, I suspect we might be reinventing the wheel. I suggest we also examine the two programmes begun six years ago to see what actually worked.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Logistics and history are fine, but we're ignoring the human element. Who is actually going to run these services? I want to see the volunteer register and supervision training to check our current capabilities.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with the need for logistical and personnel data. However, we must ensure the funding is sustainable over several years. I suggest we look into the county grant terms and the endowment.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think you're all right. I'm worried about who can actually get to us. Maybe we should also look at the attendance sheets from former outreach stops to see where people are?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Those are all great points! @Benjamin, looking at old programmes is a smart way to learn. I'll stick with the bus links and winter road closures to make sure we can actually reach everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate your enthusiasm, Yumi. To complement your logistical research and my interest in historical precedents, I shall look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, you're overlapping with Daisuke. I'll stick to my plan. I'll examine the volunteer register and supervision training, and I'll also check the neighbourhood associations and tool certification to see what skills we actually have.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Since we have the logistics and personnel covered, I will focus on the financial side. I'll look into the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, it's okay that you're looking at the attendance sheets... I'll just look into the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. I want to see who uses us when they can't visit.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,It sounds like we have a really solid plan! We're covering everything from money to people and transport. I'm happy to handle the road and bus data to keep us on track!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the division of labor is quite efficient. I shall delve into the archives to ensure we aren't merely repeating past mistakes with a fresh coat of paint. I look forward to seeing what you all discover.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is the goal here. While you all focus on where the people are and how to pay for it, I'll be the one determining if we even have the competence to execute it.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,It seems we have a comprehensive approach. I will analyze the financial structures to ensure we don't face a budget shortfall in the second year. I look forward to comparing my findings with your data.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope my data helps. I just want to make sure we don't forget the people who can't easily get to the library. I'll do my best to find something useful.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so glad we're all on the same page! Let's go find those answers and come back with everything we need to make this a success. Good luck everyone, I can't wait to hear what you find!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Good luck to you as well, Yumi. I shall retire to the records now. I trust that a bit of historical perspective will provide the necessary grounding for our upcoming deliberations. Until we meet again.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Don't get too carried away with the excitement, Yumi. Let's see if the reality of our resources actually matches your optimism. I'll be waiting to see if the numbers support your enthusiasm.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will begin my research now. I intend to identify any structural weaknesses in our funding to ensure the chosen service remains viable long-term. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll go look into the records now. I hope I can find a way to help the people who feel left out. See you all soon.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
